            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Firebase",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "32c77b60-38aa-460c-8893-e6a0b0d96616",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "const query = firestore.query(\n  collection,\n  firestore.where('status', '==', 'pending'),\n);\nconst { docs } = await firestore.getDocs(query);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "405da76b-42eb-4c86-8663-47e539cb3934",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "5dfbb04f-debb-4dad-ab3a-6e859d92ed23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Um recurso muito interessante do ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Firestore",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " é acompanhar as atualizações em tempo real. É possível acompanhar em múltiplos registros ou até mesmo um único registro. Utiliza-se o metódo ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "onSnapshot",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " para acompanhar as modificações feitas",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "52550f2b-e8f6-408c-8507-7f4e4609678f",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "useEffect(() => {\n  const subscriber = firestore.onSnapshot(collection, async (snapshot) => {\n    setTasks(snapshot.docs);\n  });\n  return subscriber;\n}, []);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "28f38a00-94e7-4b8c-ab12-d0283b19d008",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "No exemplo, a coleção inteira será observada. Ou seja, a atualização em qualquer documento irá disparar o evento ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "onSnapshot",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "7035e0f6-456e-49bd-bf0d-4ec32aa54e24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "d763944c-e80d-4a2e-9a6e-efd5ef1f20ca",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Pode-se utilizar para observar apenas registros específicos, usando uma ",
              "styles": {}
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "query",
              "styles": {
                "code": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "5c1a7d4d-4e6e-4c0c-a78f-339a9f363d13",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "useEffect(() => {\n  const query = firestore.query(\n    collection,\n    firestore.where('status', '==', 'pending'),\n  );\n  const subscriber = firestore.onSnapshot(query, async (snapshot) => {\n    setTasks(snapshot.docs);\n  });\n  return subscriber;\n}, []);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "ae384677-367a-4417-9cd1-dc941b35efc4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "d0e47baa-3b2f-4ef9-a1c9-d4dc41cdd9e1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "props": {
            "backgroundColor": "default",
            "textColor": "default",
            "textAlignment": "left"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Caso queira acompanhar as atualizações feitas em único objeto, é só informar qual documento gostaria de observar.",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "id": "65d9c1ed-173e-438e-90a3-bf63a75e2860",
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "props": {
            "language": "typescript"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "useEffect(() => {\n  const doc = firestore.doc(collection, '5wZV4I2TECWo7fnPVXdH');\n  const subscriber = firestore.onSnapshot(doc, async (snapshot) => {\n    setTasks(snapshot.docs);\n  });\n  return subscriber;\n}, []);",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ],
          "children": []
        }
